-health/publications/HRP&#x0005f;ITT&#x0005f;97&#x0005f;1/index.html</ext-link>. Accessed 12 November 2008.</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0050242-b031"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>World Health Organization</collab><year>2007</year><source>Reproductive Health Indicators Database</source><publisher-loc>Geneva</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Department of Reproductive Health and Research</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.who.int/reproductive_indicators/getexcel.asp">http://www.who.int/reproductive&#x0005f;indicators/getexcel.asp</ext-link>. Accessed 10 April 2008.</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0050242-b032"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carrara</surname><given-names>VI</given-names></name><name><surname>Sirilak</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Thonglairuam</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Rojanawatsirivet</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Proux</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Deployment of early diagnosis and mefloquine-artesunate treatment of falciparum malaria in Thailand: the Tak Malaria Initiative</article-title><source>PLoS Med</source><volume>3</volume><elocation-id>e183</elocation-id><comment> doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0030183">10.1371/journal.pmed.0030183</ext-link></comment><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16719547</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0050242-b033"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Desai</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>ter Kuile</surname><given-names>FO</given-names></name><name><surname>Nosten</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>McGready</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Asamoa</surname><given-nam